@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}
<!-- Hero Start -->
<div class="container-fluid bg-primary py-5 mb-5 hero-header">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-start">
            <div class="col-lg-8 text-center text-lg-start">
                <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">Welcome To E-Medical Instruments</h5>
                <h1 class="display-1 text-white mb-md-4">Get Your Medical ISO Certificate Now</h1>
                <div class="pt-2">
                    <a href="/Contact" class="btn btn-light rounded-pill py-md-3 px-md-5 mx-2">Contact Us</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Hero End -->
<!-- About Start -->
<div class="container-fluid py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row gx-5">
            <div class="col-lg-5 mb-5 mb-lg-0" style="min-height: 500px;">
                <div class="position-relative h-100">
                    <img class="position-absolute w-100 h-100 rounded" src="~/img/about-us.jpg"
                            alt="About Us"
                         style="object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">About Us</h5>
                </div>
                <p>In a world characterized by a constant surge of innovation and technological advancements, E-Medical Instruments stands as a beacon at the forefront of this dynamic landscape. We seamlessly integrate the latest breakthroughs in medical technology with the delicate art of medicine. Our unwavering mission is to empower medical professionals by providing them not only with easy access to the most cutting-edge medical appliances but also fostering an environment where they can immerse themselves in these advancements.</p>
                <p>At E-Medical Instruments, we recognize the pivotal role that staying abreast of the latest medical trends plays in delivering top-notch healthcare. We are committed to ensuring that medical practitioners not only keep pace with these innovations but actively participate in shaping the future of healthcare. Our approach is centered around making the adoption of these advancements as seamless as possible, thereby enhancing satisfaction for both patients and practitioners alike.</p>
                <p><a href="/About">Read More</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- About End -->
<!-- Branches Start -->
<div class="container-fluid py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">Our Branches</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-5 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-item bg-light rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
                    <div class="service-icon mb-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-globe fs-2 text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="mb-3">E-Medical France</h4>
                    <p class="m-0"><a href="https://www.e-medicalfrance.com" target="_blank">www.e-medicalfrance.com</a></p>
                    <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary rounded-pill" href="https://www.e-medicalfrance.com" target="_blank">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Branches End -->
<!-- Services Start -->
<div class="container-fluid py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">Services</h5>
            <h1 class="display-4">Medical Services</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-item bg-light rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
                    <div class="service-icon mb-4">
                        <i class="fa fa-2x fa-procedures text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="mb-3">Dental Equipment Rental</h4>
                    <p class="m-0">
                        Explore our wide range of innovative dental devices available for short or
                        long-term rental.
                    </p>
                    <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary rounded-pill" href="/Services">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-item bg-light rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
                    <div class="service-icon mb-4">
                        <i class="fa fa-2x fa-user-md  text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="mb-3">Training</h4>
                    <p class="m-0">
                        Our expert-led training programmes are designed to provide dental teams with the
                        knowledge and skills they need to optimise equipment usage.
                    </p>
                    <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary rounded-pill" href="/Services">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="service-item bg-light rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
                    <div class="service-icon mb-4">
                        <i class="fa fa-2x fa-stethoscope text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="mb-3">Consultation & Support</h4>
                    <p class="m-0">
                        In addition to renting equipment and offering training, we provide
                        continuous consultation and support
                    </p>
                    <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary rounded-pill" href="/Services">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Services End -->
<!-- Search Start -->
<div class="container-fluid bg-primary my-5 py-5">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <h5 class="d-inline-block text-white text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">Find A Certified Clinic</h5>
            <h1 class="display-4 mb-4">Find an ISO Certifed Clinic Near You</h1>
            <h5 class="text-white fw-normal">Empower yourself by making informed decisions about your healthcare. Explore our "Certified Clinics" page and take a step towards receiving quality care from certified professionals.</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px;">
            <form action="/Certified">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input type="text" class="form-control border-primary w-50" placeholder="Keyword">
                    <button class="btn btn-dark border-0 w-25">Search</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Search End -->
<!-- Testimonial Start -->
<div class="container-fluid py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <h5 class="d-inline-block text-primary text-uppercase border-bottom border-5">Testimonials</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="owl-carousel testimonial-carousel">
                    <div class="testimonial-item text-center">
                        <div class="position-relative mb-5 text-center">
                            <i class="fa fa-quote-left fa-2x text-primary"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="fs-4 fw-normal">E-Medical Instruments has been a game-changer for my practice. 
                            The seamless process of renting top-notch medical equipment combined with personalized training and coaching has significantly elevated the quality of service we provide. The ISO certification adds an extra layer of trust. Highly recommend for any professional seeking excellence!</p>
                        <hr class="w-25 mx-auto">
                        <h3>Dr. Irini</h3>
                        <h6 class="fw-normal text-primary mb-3">Dental Practitioner</h6>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial-item text-center">
                        <div class="position-relative mb-5 text-center">
                            <i class="fa fa-quote-left fa-2x text-primary"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="fs-4 fw-normal">Our experience with E-Medical Instruments has been nothing short of outstanding. The convenience of renting medical equipments, 
                            coupled with the insightful training programs and coaching sessions, has greatly improved our clinic's efficiency. 
                            The team's commitment to excellence shines through, making them a valuable partner for any healthcare facility.</p>
                        <hr class="w-25 mx-auto">
                        <h3>Odysseas</h3>
                        <h6 class="fw-normal text-primary mb-3">Clinic Manager</h6>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial-item text-center">
                        <div class="position-relative mb-5 text-center">
                            <i class="fa fa-quote-left fa-2x text-primary"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="fs-4 fw-normal">As a recent graduate entering the world of dentistry, E-Medical Instruments has been my go-to resource. The equipment rental options allowed me to set up my practice without a hefty upfront investment. The training and coaching provided were instrumental in boosting my confidence. Grateful for the support in my early career journey!</p>
                        <hr class="w-25 mx-auto">
                        <h3>Dr. Sophia</h3>
                        <h6 class="fw-normal text-primary mb-3">Recent Graduate</h6>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Testimonial End -->
